t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">亏损超80亿、算力承诺546亿:Anthropic招股书揭开大模型顶流的真实账本</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI联合红帽与英伟达研发OCE1.0，打造面向AI代理的企业级Kubernetes</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AMD CEO苏姿丰下月访韩，拟敲定三星电子作为HBM4内存供应商</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌向免费用户开放Gemini Skills，Gems功能将于11月完成整合</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3dd79068710eb030bec9c04638f92175.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式宣布将此前仅限Pro和Ultra付费订阅用户使用的Gemini Skills自定义指令服务，全面向所有免费账户用户开放。此次功能迭代旨在降低个性化AI的使用门槛，提升Gemini在大众市场的用户粘性。在系统整合方面，原有的Gems功能确定将于2026年11月17日自动过渡至全新升级的Skills系统中。升级后的Skills保留了原有的自定义配置能力，并优化了底层交互逻辑，用户在主聊天框输入斜杠（/）加指令即可唤醒特定AI技能。对于免费用户，系统支持完整保留既往自定义配置，并可通过专属链接创建新Skills，确保在系统迁移期间实现无缝过渡。此次调整标志着谷歌进一步强化了Gemini平台的个性化交互能力，通过技术下放提升了整体平台竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软联手哈佛MIT发布生物学世界模型Project Quine，加速药物筛选</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/049dadf42e5f697b56c1bd53c8e01875.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软研究院联合哈佛大学与麻省理工学院博德研究所，正式推出实验性多模态AI系统Project Quine，旨在构建生物学研究的世界模型。该系统将基因组学、蛋白质结构、化学分子、细胞状态及生物成像等多领域数据统一至同一表征空间，通过交互式推理框架实现跨模态分析，解决了计算生物学中各数据维度难以统一推理的瓶颈。在实际测试中，Project Quine展现出极高的研发效率，仅用一个周末便成功筛选出抗癌候选物，将传统药物发现与验证周期从数月压缩至数天。该系统通过整合计算建模与湿实验，大幅降低了药物研发的时间与经济成本。目前，微软已启动首届Quine Fellows项目，开放科研人员申请试用，未来计划将该技术逐步推广至更广泛的商业化场景，推动AI在生命科学领域的深度应用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亏损超80亿、算力承诺546亿:Anthropic招股书揭开大模型顶流的真实账本</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ab7742c19edc16283651a5f2488dbbf0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亏损超80亿、算力承诺546亿:Anthropic招股书揭开大模型顶流的真实账本AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 30, 202622Anthropic近日向部分合作伙伴披露其IPO招股说明书，计划以约2万亿美元的目标估值推进上市。数据显示，公司2025年营收同比增长12倍至近46亿美元，近三分之二来自美国市场，但同期运营亏损亦翻倍突破80亿美元。在商业化结构上，Claude模型以用量计费为主导，贡献约38亿美元收入，订阅业务仅实现7.89亿美元（占比不足20%）。招股书清晰显现出其对头部科技巨头的深度绑定:2025年，Anthropic通过亚马逊和谷歌云平台斩获21.6亿美元收入，营收占比由2023年的11%大幅攀升至47%，并为此支付约3.51亿美元渠道抽成。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI联合红帽与英伟达研发OCE1.0，打造面向AI代理的企业级Kubernetes</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2cb8beb2512d5a53b38af86ce5743167.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI、红帽（Red Hat）与英伟达等多方正联合开发开源智能体框架的企业级版本OpenClaw Enterprise（OCE1.0），旨在解决政企客户对AI代理的安全顾虑，该项目被定位为“面向代理的Kubernetes”。OCE1.0由OpenAI内部发起并捐赠给OpenClaw基金会，旨在解决原版OpenClaw因安全机制薄弱被Gartner定性为“不可接受风险”并遭企业封禁的问题。OCE1.0引入了企业级控制平面，原生支持多租户隔离、严苛安全边界控制及标准化代理原语，并提供完善的治理与可审计性，允许企业灵活替换底层框架、模型及沙箱。红帽副总裁Joe Fernandes将其类比为推动Linux及容器商用的RHEL和OpenShift。此举标志着AI智能体正从消费端探索转向生产力基础设施，为企业在合规前</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AMD CEO苏姿丰下月访韩，拟敲定三星电子作为HBM4内存供应商</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4913ccd3981ba570d2bd86e12ae78ac2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AMD CEO苏姿丰计划于下月亲赴韩国，与三星电子高层会谈，旨在落实三星作为AMD下一代AI加速器HBM4内存供应商的合作。双方此前于今年3月签署了关于AI存储芯片与计算技术的谅解备忘录，此次会晤有望将优先供应意向转化为正式订单。HBM4作为AI加速器的关键内存层级，其供应稳定性直接决定了AMD未来旗舰芯片的产能与交付节奏。除三星外，苏姿丰此行还将接触韩国本土NPU企业，进一步完善AMD在AI算力链条的布局。通过深化与韩国半导体产业链的合作，AMD意在将下一代AI加速器的核心供应链命脉掌握在可控范围内，以应对日益激烈的AI算力竞争。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
